{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000cc89","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0a823-e600-7521-9ce0-62cc9653cb46"},"sequence":1183,"recorded_at":1780531400002361,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"a02c0fe6-9135-4b16-8f63-6f987d7b0b4a","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"a02c0fe6-9135-4b16-8f63-6f987d7b0b4a","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"a02c0fe6-9135-4b16-8f63-6f987d7b0b4a"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0a82c-7353-7900-a714-1185fddc9bf8"},"task_id":"01a0a82c-7353-7900-a714-1185fddc9bf8","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0a82c-7353-7900-a714-1185fddc9bf8","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-20-1\",\n  \"command\": \"cat >> .spec/github-login-device-flow.md <<'EOF'\\n\\n## Session restore\\n\\n- `GitHubAuth.Effect.restoreSession` runs once at startup (`AppRegistry`).\\n  It loads non-secret identity (`serverHost`, `userID`, `clientID`,\\n  `username`) from UserDefaults, loads the Keychain record, validates via\\n  `GET /user`, then loads installations (+ first-installation repositories).\\n- 401/revoked/`invalid_grant` clears Keychain + identity and requires\\n  relogin. Offline/403 keeps the restored session with a stale `syncFailed`\\n  marker; logout stays available and deletes both stores.\\n- Identity holds no tokens. `logout` also clears persisted stores when the\\n  in-memory session is already gone, so relaunch can never orphan tokens.\\nEOF\\necho done\",\n  \"description\": \"Append restore section to login spec\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"done\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 5,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 2,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
